caption: Effective Talent
technology-rule: effective-talent

A chem designer uses:

Effective Talent = Actual Talent + max(0, TL - 8)

Each TL above TL8 grants +1 Effective Talent.

| Tech Level | Talent bonus |
| --- | --- |
| TL8 or lower | +0 |
| TL9 | +1 |
| TL10 | +2 |
| TL11 | +3 |
| TL12 | +4 |

This bonus allows sufficiently advanced pharmaceutical science to create basic chems without innate Talent or access to a special Tradition.

It does not replace the necessary invention, scientific, or manufacturing skills.
